      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone home?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is anyone house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse3.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I start talking to an anime figure on Ami’s desk, hoping that it can tell me something about why she and everyone else have vanished.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It doesn’t tell me anything other than things I already know- like how much water we’re supposed to consume on a daily basis or where to locate the clitoris.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think it’s amazing how far technology has come in the fact that we can now learn things like this from anime figures, but I knock it off the table when I realize it expected me to be an idiot.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I am a smart man who knows smart things.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I will not be insulted by a toy.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you house?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I ask it again just to be sure.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No response.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Darn it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene helloandwelcometohouse4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/helloandwelcometohouse4.webp",
      "alt": "helloandwelcometohouse4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I decide to make one last leap of faith and check the bathroom.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Once again, there is no one here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t really know what I was expecting.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve heard it’s common for girls to bathe together, but it’s not like I expected three of them to fit in there at once.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh well.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess I’ll go to sleep.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
