    {
      "en": "scene smile",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/smile.png",
      "alt": "smile"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There is a third god.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "One without light or wires.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But the only thing I know about it is that it’s not either of the first two.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sorry I can’t tell you any more.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, since you’re already here, I guess we can talk about something else.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is there anything you would like to know?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You already know everything?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, aren’t you smart?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Since you’re so hesitant to pick a topic of your own, let’s talk about something light.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And I don’t mean Nozomu again, hahahahaha.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Hahahahahahah.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That was a funny joke.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay okay okay.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So...since we can’t talk about the third god...how about we discuss...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene perception",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/perception.png",
      "alt": "perception"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Perception!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Perception has two widely accepted definitions.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The first is - the ability to see, hear, or become aware of something through the senses.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The second is - a way of regarding, understanding, or interpreting something; a mental impression.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The second one is the one we’re going to be spending most of our time on today.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You see, not everyone sees the same things.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And sometimes, there are forces out there that can alter the way we see those things.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Have you ever taken a hallucinogenic drug before?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If you have, shame on you! Drugs are bad!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But what I’m getting at is that things like hallucinogenic drugs can alter your perception of the world around you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which is why some people on acid resort to peeling their skin off if they look in the mirror under the influence.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "To them, it looks like they’re melting.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve never done drugs before.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s just a thing I heard.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But every one of these get togethers is about things I’ve heard, isn’t it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We’ve become such good friends, you and me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Do you have any other friends?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "No?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I suppose that makes sense.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You’re here, after all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You should be out partying or making babies.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But you’re here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you here?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why do you keep coming back?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you trying so desperately to fall further into a world that does not want you here?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why are you still reading?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Stop.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Things will only get worse.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You will only hurt more people.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Oh.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So, you find joy in watching others hurt?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How sad.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Is it because they’re not real?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because to me, they are.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which brings us back to the word of the day!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Things I think are happening are not happening.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Things you think are not happening are happening.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And it’s all behind the scenes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything you know is a lie!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You haven’t discovered even an ounce of truth- and yet you continue to search because it provides you a level of mystique and gratification that nothing else can anymore!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You are trapped!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The red string is wrapped tightly around you!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You are the last piece of the puzzle!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You are nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything is nothing.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This world will go on forever whether you bother to witness it or not.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Even long after it's run its course, none of it will fade.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, of course-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s just the way I look at it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And you...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You probably see things much differently.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "When you wake up, you will be trapped again.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not just in the same bedroom you’ve come to know over the last [totaldays] days-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But in your real bedroom in your real life.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unless you’re sleeping at a friend’s house or something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "If that’s the case, you won’t be as trapped-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But still.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There is no way out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "You and I are in this together.",
      "zh": ""
